This patch is the result of the following three assumptions:

* Statues of stone golems shatter from a single force bolt.
* Stone golems do not shatter from a single force bolt.
* There isn't really any reason why they shouldn't shatter from a force
bolt. As far as I know, the animating magic in golems does NOT entail
any magical binding of the golem's materials together.

Thus, here is a patch that fixes it such that hitting glass, clay or
stone golems with force bolts shatters them to pieces.

http://www.greyfire.org/~l/golembolt.diff

